.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH signstar-request-signature-send 1  "signstar-request-signature-send " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
signstar\-request\-signature\-send \- Send signing request over SSH
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsignstar\-request\-signature send\fR <\fB\-\-host\fR> [\fB\-\-port\fR] <\fB\-\-user\fR> <\fB\-\-agent\-socket\fR> <\fB\-\-user\-public\-key\fR> <\fB\-\-known\-hosts\fR> [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR]... [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIINPUT\fR> 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Send signing request over SSH
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-host\fR \fI<HOST>\fR
Signstar host
.TP
\fB\-\-port\fR \fI<PORT>\fR [default: 22]
Signstar port
.TP
\fB\-\-user\fR \fI<USER>\fR
Signstar user
.TP
\fB\-\-agent\-socket\fR \fI<AGENT_SOCKET>\fR
Path to the agent socket used for user authentication
.TP
\fB\-\-user\-public\-key\fR \fI<USER_PUBLIC_KEY>\fR
Public key of a user
.TP
\fB\-\-known\-hosts\fR \fI<KNOWN_HOSTS>\fR
Path of a known hosts file which contains public keys of the serevr
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Increase logging verbosity
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Decrease logging verbosity
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIINPUT\fR>
The path to a file being signed
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBSIGNSTAR_REQUEST_FILE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
